{
  "_comment": [
    "Campaign-wide wavefront inventory of the libgit2 wrap campaign: the libgit2.so link unit. Its impl_files and api_headers are the union of every module's configuration under configs/libgit2/<module index>/, so it owns everything and sets no items lists; binders, translators and reviewers resolve their queries through it, and its graph orders the modules and relates them. Paths are below the C root, c/, wavefront's repo_root. The TUs of libgit2.so's link line that the configured build compiles empty (src/libgit2/streams/openssl_dynamic.c, openssl_legacy.c, schannel.c, stransport.c, src/libgit2/transports/auth_gssapi.c, auth_sspi.c, ssh_exec.c, winhttp.c) are configured out, as are the deprecated shims deprecated.h, cred_helpers.h and sys/cred.h and the MSVC-only stdint.h; headers that define only macros belong to no module."
  ],
